{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56162","headline":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 二 · 杜光庭","name":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乙丑春，瘟灾害万民。\n夏首灾疫起，偏伤楚鲁人。\n家类悉糊口，吴地又分张。\n民奔千里外，六畜悉逢殃。\n高田但种植，低处伤苗秀。\n灾疫如去年，不得归家守。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}